  "details": "PLEASE HELP :')!\n\nIve followed EVERY STEP in every other forum which includes:\n\n-uninstalling/reinstalling steam\n\n-going in \\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\VRChat and deleting VRChat Folder\n\n-Changing characters in the desktop mode (for the hopes of it helping)\n\n-Reset bindings\n\n-reset Quest 2 Headset \n\nIf it helps i went into the controller debugging UI and it says everything is false.\n\nexample:\n\nSource -\n\nBinding - (priority 0)\n\nActive - False\n\nOrigin -\n\nValue - False\n\n(its like that on every /action/legacy)\n\nBut i have the same issues as the other people who fixed their bug (controllers work everywhere BUT VRChat (and OVR Toolkit)), been troubleshooting for hours and still nothing works. HALP!\n\n(p.s everything was fine until the new Steam VR and VRChat update sadge. But again my controllers work in steam vr menu so i think it really is just VRChat?) :')",
